 "coaching_points": [
  "Warm up 2-3 minutes \u2014 light jog, leg swings, ankle rolls and easy juggling touches before working at pace",
  "One ball: after each rep jog to where the ball settled beyond the gate and dribble it back to the center spot \u2014 that jog is your rest",
  "Toss the ball up softly to head-height so it drops bouncing in front of you \u2014 vary the height and which side it lands each rep",
  "Scan the gates BEFORE the ball drops \u2014 pick your exit gate while the ball is in the air, then take ONE cushioned touch through it",
  "Cushion with a relaxed foot \u2014 meet the dropping ball with a soft ankle so it dies exactly in your chosen direction, not bouncing away",
  "The first touch itself must send the ball through the gate \u2014 a settle-then-push is two touches and doesn't count; direct redirect only",
  "Target: 7 of 10 first touches carry the ball cleanly through a gate within one touch \u2014 count out loud, rotate all four gates",
  "10 reps per set, 4 sets; collecting the ball and walking back is the rest between reps",
  "Hit 8/10 \u2192 toss higher and faster for a harder bounce; miss 5 \u2192 widen the gates or toss softer to get clean contact first"
 ],
 "variations": [
  "Weak foot only \u2014 every first touch with the weak foot, strong-foot touches don't count",
  "Thigh-then-foot \u2014 cushion the drop on your thigh, drop it, then first-touch through the gate",
  "Full version needs a server feeding varied bouncing balls with a defender at your back \u2014 add a partner when you have one"
 ],
